    "https://lsus.edu2.com/category/1/online-classes": {
      "title": "Louisiana State University Shreveport Online Certification Courses",
      "description": "Louisiana State University Shreveport Online Certification Courses Louisiana State University Shreveport uses cookies for analytics, advertising, and to offer you the best online experience possible.\nYou accept our use of cookies by continuing to browse our site or closing this message.\nTo learn more, including how to change your settings, see our Privacy Policy. Read more... Accept Skip to Main Content 0 My Courses My Courses Online Classes Healthcare Healthcare in Spanish Software, IT & Web Development Skilled Trades & Technology Business, Management & Accounting Project Management & Quality Assurance Education Law Criminal Justice Digital Arts Academic Foundations View All MyCAA Army CA Support Learning You Can Take Anywhere Online classes on your time, on any device, anywhere you happen to be. × Comprehensive Career Programs Job & Externship Opportunities Payment Plan Options Certification Opportunities Career Tracks Courses Healthcare From Medical Assisting to Phlebotomy and Dental Assisting, the need for healthcare technicians at all levels continues to grow. Courses Healthcare in Spanish Desde la asistencia médica hasta la flebotomía y la asistencia dental, la necesidad de técnicos sanitarios en todos los niveles sigue creciendo. Courses Software, IT & Web Development The need for skilled technicians to support end-users, manage cyber security or develop engaging and beautiful web pages continues to grow. Courses Skilled Trades & Technology Trades are the most high-tech areas with the most demand for new employees to learn these timeless skills from electrical and plumbing to welding. Courses Business, Management & Accounting From Entrepreneurship to Finance, Leadership and Bookkeeping - there's something for everyone to learn when it comes to business and management. Courses Project Management & Quality Assurance Let's start getting things done - on time and on budget.  Managing projects from start to finish and overseeing a team requires a unique skill set. Courses Education Learn about early childhood education and curriculum design to discover how you can make an impact on students' lives. Courses Law Learn the ins and outs of different areas of the law or discover all of them to work as a legal assistant or paralegal. Courses Criminal Justice Programs bring to life the most interesting areas of the criminal justice system to prepare learners for a variety of jobs. Courses Digital Arts From Photography to Adobe software training, Art has gone tech!  Tap into your creativity and put it to work with skills employers need in all areas. Courses Academic Foundations All the subjects you took or didn't take in school -- from Psychology to Environmental Science or Sociology -- available at your fingertips! Louisiana State University Shreveport Division of Continuing Education and Public Service To be eligible for a return, your return request must be made within 30 days of original purchase and the user's “time in content” must not exceed 10 total hours. Please refer to our full return policy. Our Services Online Programs MyCAA Programs Army CA Support About Us Contact Us Useful links Return Policy Privacy Policy Security Terms & Conditions Contact Tulin Melancon Continuing Education Louisiana State University Shreveport Shreveport, LA 71115 Contact Us 888.574.6218 © 2026  |  edu2   |  All Rights Reserved Chat with us , powered by LiveChat"
    },
    "https://lsus.edu2.com/topic/mycaaprograms": {
      "title": "Military Spouse Career Advancement Accounts (MyCAA) Online Certification Programs",
      "description": "Military Spouse Career Advancement Accounts (MyCAA) Online Certification Programs Louisiana State University Shreveport uses cookies for analytics, advertising, and to offer you the best online experience possible.\nYou accept our use of cookies by continuing to browse our site or closing this message.\nTo learn more, including how to change your settings, see our Privacy Policy. Read more... Accept Skip to Main Content 0 My Courses My Courses Online Classes Healthcare Healthcare in Spanish Software, IT & Web Development Skilled Trades & Technology Business, Management & Accounting Project Management & Quality Assurance Education Law Criminal Justice Digital Arts Academic Foundations View All MyCAA Army CA Support Military Spouse Career Advancement Accounts (MyCAA) You have our back. And we've got yours. The Military Spouse Career Advancement Accounts (MyCAA) program provides financial assistance for military spouses. MyCAA provides spouses up to $4,000 over 2 years to pursue degree programs, licenses or credentials that lead to employment in portable career fields. The MyCAA program is available to spouses of active duty service members in pay grades E1-E6, W1-W2, and O1-O3 or spouses of activated Guard and Reserve members at E1-E6, W1-W2 and O1-O3 pay grades (spouses of Guard and Reserve members must be able to start and complete their courses while their sponsor is on Title 10 orders) Note: The MyCAA program does not include Coast Guard spouses. The first 1,250 approved applicants in pay grades E-6 and O-3 will receive MyCAA financial assistance based on available funding. Eligibility Info What are the Benefits? MyCAA Financial Assistance (FA) pays tuition for education and training courses, and licensing/credentialing fees. This includes: State certifications for teachers, medical professionals and other occupations requiring recognized certifications; Licensing exams and related prep courses; Continuing Education Unit (CEU) classes; Degree programs leading to employment in portable career fields; and High school completion course, GED tests, and English as a Second Language (ESL) classes. How do I apply? Eligible spouses can establish a MyCAA account by visiting the MyCAA website. Once a spouse's profile information is provided, MyCAA will verify the spouse's benefit eligibility with the Defense Enrollment Eligibility Reporting System (DEERS). Eligible spouses will be allowed to create their Career and Training Plan and request financial assistance at least 30 days prior to the course start dates. Who is eligible for MyCAA? Spouses of active-duty service members and spouses of National Guard and reserve service members on Title 10 orders in pay grades E-1 through E-9, W-1 through W-3 and O-1 through O-3. Available Programs Online Class Assisted Living Technician This program will ensure learners are prepared to provide a variety of essential services for their clients with the compassion, sensitivity and understanding necessary to provide care when needed and independence when not. Enroll Now Entry-Level Clinical Practice 4-6 Months Online Class Associate Professional in Human Resources (aPHR™) The number of HR professions in the U.S. is expected to rise faster than the national average over the next 10 years, making this a great focus for students looking to enter the business world. Enroll Now Entry-Level Business & Management 4-6 Months Online Class Clinical Medical Assistant This medical assisting program prepares students to work in hospitals, physician practices and other healthcare settings; assisting with labs, EKG’s, clinical services and other aspects of patient care. Enroll Now Entry-Level Clinical Practice 4-6 Months Online Class Clinical Medical Assistant (Spanish Version) El programa de asistencia médica clínica ha sido diseñado con el fin de preparar a los estudiantes para funcionar como profesionales en múltiples entornos de atención médica. Enroll Now Entry-Level Práctica Clinica 4-6 Months Online Class Clinical Medical Assistant w/ OBGYN This medical assisting program prepares students to work in hospitals, physician practices and other healthcare settings; assisting with labs, EKG’s, clinical services and other aspects of patient care. Enroll Now Entry-Level Clinical Practice 4-6 Months Online Class Clinical Medical Assistant w/ OBGYN (Spanish Version) El programa de asistencia médica clínica para obstetricia y ginecología ha sido diseñado con el fin de preparar a los estudiantes para funcionar como profesionales en múltiples entornos de atención médica. Enroll Now Entry-Level Clinical Practice 4-6 Months Online Class Clinical Medical Assistant w/ Pediatrics This medical assisting program prepares students to work in hospitals, physician practices and other healthcare settings; assisting with labs, EKG’s, clinical services and other aspects of patient care. Enroll Now Entry-Level Clinical Practice 4-6 Months Online Class Clinical Medical Assistant w/ Pediatrics (Spanish Version) El programa de asistencia médica clínica de pediatría ha sido diseñado con el fin de preparar a los estudiantes para funcionar como profesionales en múltiples entornos de atención médica. Enroll Now Entry-Level Clinical Practice 4-6 Months Online Class Clinical Nurse Aide With the demands for healthcare growing every day, clinical nurse aides are absolutely vital to daily operations in hospitals and nursing care facilities. Enroll Now Entry-Level Clinical Practice 4-6 Months Online Class Computer Support Specialist This program prepares students for a role in supporting computer users by installing, configuring, troubleshooting, and managing computers, hardware, wired and wireless networks. Enroll Now Entry-Level Information Technology 4-6 Months Online Class Computer Technician (CompTIA A+) Gain the essential skills and technical expertise necessary to install, upgrade, configure, troubleshoot, optimize, repair and perform preventative maintenance on basic personal computer hardware and operating systems. Enroll Now Entry-Level Information Technology 4-6 Months Online Class EKG Technician EKG technicians are in demand! This program covers topics and processes critical to conducting and interpreting EKGs as an important member of the healthcare team. Enroll Now Entry-Level Clinical Practice 2-4 Months Online Class Electronic Health Records Management With the healthcare system moving to electronic medical records, there are lots of opportunities for medical assistants, health information systems staff, patient registration professionals and more. Enroll Now Entry-Level Administrative Support 4-6 Months Online Class LEED Green Associate (GA) Learners will be introduced the components of building construction and key concepts to prepare for the LEED® Green Associate v4™ accreditation. Enroll Now Entry-Level Green Building & Sustainability 4-6 Months Online Class Medical Administrative Assistant This program prepares students to function effectively in many of the administrative and support positions at hospitals, physician practices and with other healthcare providers. Enroll Now Entry-Level Administrative Support 4-6 Months Online Class Medical Billing & Coding with Medical Administration Medical billing and coding and medical administration is one of the fastest-growing careers in the healthcare industry today! Enroll Now Entry-Level Administrative Support 4-6 Months Online Class Medical Billing & Coding The need for professionals who understand how to code healthcare services and procedures, using ICD-10, CPT and HCPCS,  for third-party insurance reimbursement is growing substantially. Enroll Now Entry-Level Administrative Support 4-6 Months Online Class Medical Billing & Coding (Spanish Version) La necesidad de profesionales que entiendan cómo codificar los servicios de salud y los procedimientos para el reembolso de seguros a terceros está creciendo sustancialmente. Enroll Now Entry-Level Administrative Support 4-6 Months Online Class Network Technician (CompTIA Network+) The Network Technician (CompTIA Network+) program is designed to prepare students to function as computer professionals in multiple technical, business, and healthcare settings. Enroll Now Intermediate Information Technology 4-6 Months Online Class Nursing Assistant Specialist With the demands for healthcare growing every day, nursing assistants are absolutely vital to daily operations in hospitals and nursing care facilities. Enroll Now Entry-Level Clinical Practice 4-6 Months Online Class Paralegal Professional Paralegals require a fundamental understanding of the substantive and procedural elements applicable to the specific areas of law where they’ll be working so that they can build on a solid foundation of knowledge. Enroll Now Entry-Level Law 4-6 Months Online Class Personal Care Assistant Personal Care Assistants provide assistance to elderly, disabled, ill, and mentally disabled persons who live in their own homes or in a residential care facility. Enroll Now Entry-Level Clinical Practice 4-6 Months Online Class Pharmacy Technician with Medical Administration This program prepares learners to function both as Pharmacy Technicians and also provides a comprehensive understanding of medical administration tasks. Enroll Now Entry-Level Administrative Support 4-6 Months Online Class Pharmacy Technician The need for PTCB certified Pharmacy Technicians continues to grow with demand for state certified technicians expected to increase substantially through 2026. Enroll Now Entry-Level Clinical Practice 2-4 Months Online Class Phlebotomy Technician The phlebotomist is a vital member of the clinical laboratory team, whose main function is to obtain patient’s blood specimens by venipuncture and micro-collection for testing purposes. Enroll Now Entry-Level Clinical Practice 2-4 Months Online Class Physician's Office Assistant with EHRM Healthcare professionals with the ability to understand, update and maintain the electronic health record as part of their role as medical office assistants are in great demand. Enroll Now Entry-Level Administrative Support 4-6 Months Online Class Project Management Professional (PMP®) The program includes training and exam preparation for students to become a Project Management Professional (PMP®) as designated by the Project Management Institute. Enroll Now Intermediate Project Management 4-6 Months Online Class Six Sigma Black Belt This advanced-level program guides learners through elemental Six Sigma material before diving into each of the five DMAIC stages in detail. Enroll Now Advanced Quality Assurance 4-6 Months Online Class EKG Technician (Spanish Version) ¡Los técnicos de EKG están en demanda! Pueden trabajar en consultorios médicos, hospitales, clínicas y otras instalaciones y organizaciones dedicadas a la atención médica. Enroll Now Entry-Level Práctica Clinica 2-4 Months Online Class Phlebotomy Technician (Spanish Version) El flebotomista es un miembro vital del equipo del laboratorio clínico, cuya función principal es obtener muestras de sangre del paciente mediante punción venosa y microcolección con fines de prueba. Enroll Now Entry-Level Práctica Clinica 2-4 Months Online Class Sterile Processing & Surgical Technologist This program provides an introduction to the surgical technologist career, role in the operating room, and\nfoundational concepts. Enroll Now Entry-Level Clinical Support 4-6 Months Online Class Sterile Processing Technician This program is designed to prepare students to function as a sterile processing professional in multiple healthcare settings Enroll Now Entry-Level Clinical Support 4-6 Months Louisiana State University Shreveport Division of Continuing Education and Public Service To be eligible for a return, your return request must be made within 30 days of original purchase and the user's “time in content” must not exceed 10 total hours. Please refer to our full return policy. Our Services Online Programs MyCAA Programs Army CA Support About Us Contact Us Useful links Return Policy Privacy Policy Security Terms & Conditions Contact Tulin Melancon Continuing Education Louisiana State University Shreveport Shreveport, LA 71115 Contact Us 888.574.6218 © 2026  |  edu2   |  All Rights Reserved Chat with us , powered by LiveChat"
    },
